  "body": "# gh-sdp 2.3.2\n\nDistributes the signed SDPTool 2.3.2 engine unchanged.\n\n- Increases generated preview bundle capacity from 128 files / 32 MiB to 512 files / 128 MiB for SDL preview and project source reading.\n- Reports actual usage when a bundle exceeds the limits.\n- Retains supported signed Framework upgrade predecessors, including 2.3.1.\n\nUpgrade the extension with `gh extension upgrade sdp`. Project Framework upgrades remain explicit operations.\n"
